  follows="left|top"
  layout="topleft"
  left="12"
  top="32"
  height="62"
  width="500"
  word_wrap="true"
  name="vr_note">
VR needs a running VR runtime (WiVRn server) and a connected headset. Without them the viewer stays on the desktop and shows a note. If the headset is lost during VR, the viewer returns to the desktop by itself. Settings on these pages act at once, unless noted.
 </text>
